<div class="wrap page">
<div class="intro">
<p class="eyebrow">The process</p>
<h1>How an honoree is chosen</h1>
<p class="lede">Five steps, from evidence to announcement. Each one is set out in the charter, and the forms used are published below.</p>
</div>

<ol class="steps">
{%- for s in steps %}
<li>
<div class="when"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="date">{{ s[0] }}</span></div>
<div class="what"><h2>{{ s[1] }}</h2><p>{{ s[2] }}</p></div>
</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>

<section class="stack">
<h2>Safeguards</h2>
<div class="cards">
{%- for g in safeguards %}
<div><h3>{{ g[0] }}</h3><p>{{ g[1] }}</p></div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</section>

<section class="stack" style="gap:20px">
<h2>The forms we use</h2>
<div class="doclist">
{%- for f in forms %}
<a href="{{ f[0] | url }}"><span class="t"><span class="t1">{{ f[1] }}</span><span class="t2">{{ f[2] }}</span></span><span class="go">Read →</span></a>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</section>
